 reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Jane runs 3 kilometers in two hours. What is her speed in meters per minute?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["25"], "solution": "25"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 21475, 8473, 220, 18, 40568, 304, 1378, 4115, 13, 3555, 374, 1059, 4628, 304, 20044, 817, 9383, 5267, 36842, 25, 151645, 198, 151644, 77091, 198], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 752, 1430, 311, 7071, 700, 419, 3491, 13, 2055, 11, 21475, 8473, 220, 18, 40568, 304, 1378, 4115, 11, 323, 358, 1184, 311, 1477, 1059, 4628, 304, 20044, 817, 9383, 13, 88190, 11, 1077, 594, 1191, 553, 88646, 279, 6770, 14806, 369, 4628, 13, 358, 1744, 4628, 374, 6010, 17779, 553, 882, 13, 1988, 2474, 279, 3405, 6801, 279]}
